-- RM-TP-3-FOOTPRINT-TEARDOWN (2026-11-05, charter pillar core; roadmap row id 128, docs/TRANSFORMATION-PROGRAM.md T3; sub-agent c5-resilience of the owner request "CODE, DEPLOY, AND CLOSE ALL OPEN ROADMAP AND BACKLOG TASKS").
-- Re-measured 2026-11-05 ~00:30Z against the exit "worker_count <= 24, d1 <= 8, workflows <= 25": worker_count 39 and worker_count_disagreement 1 (metric_registry); 10 D1 databases (docs/SYSTEM-MAP.md); 76 workflow files before this pull request;
-- 36 live worker directories (a wrangler.toml and no RETIRED or FOLDED marker), every one declaring "# charter-pillar:" (scripts/charter-guard.py check C6 enforces it); 64 directories with a wrangler.toml and a RETIRED or FOLDED marker still at the repository root.
