-- (archive/ATTACH-WORKFLOWS-MANIFEST.md has the table and the evidence); workflows 76 to 71. Marks T3 lever 9 landed (the pillar line on every live wrangler.toml is enforced and met). Files the three next slices as ROADMAP-1 issues with a doer, each with code-task, code-anchor and code-probe.
-- NOT DONE and not claimed: the worker folds (owned by agent_issues 1001901 to 1001908 WORKER-COUNT-1.1 to 1.8 and by the breach-cost-retire session), workflows 71 to 25, d1 10 to 8, the archive/ move of the dead directories, qnfo-audit retention and the table registry (RETENTION-SWEEP-1, agent_issues 1001676).
